<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-WMC year net profit up 20.4 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-WMC year net profit up 20.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    525.9 vs 433.9</p>
<p>    Net (equity)			  386.2 vs 320.8</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	     11.0 vs 12.00</p>
<p>NOTE: WMC Ltd is a base and precious metals miner.</p>
</text>
